    "description": "Editing, committed, pushed, pull request open, then checks green and merged. From pull request open a failing check leads to checks red. From checks red the only route returns to editing to fix the cause, drawn as a heavy dipped arc. A route from checks red to merged, a bypass, is forbidden, drawn dashed with a cross.",
